OL,4,CBody found in woodland confirmed as    
OL,5,Cmissing Kelsey Hunter                  
OL,6,GPolice have confirmed that a body      
OL,7,Gfound in woodland in southern Scotland 
OL,8,Ghas been identified as missing 20-year-
OL,9,Gold Kelsey Hunter.                     
OL,11,FShe had last been seen in Castle       
OL,12,FDouglas at 17:00 on Saturday and a     
OL,13,Fmajor search was carried out around    
OL,14,Fthe nearby village of Springholm where 
OL,15,Fshe lived.                             
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, Daniel McKnight, 21,       
OL,18,Fappeared on petition at Dumfries       
OL,19,FSheriff Court charged with murder and  
OL,20,Ftwo other charges, including defeating 
OL,21,Fthe ends of justice. Kelsey's body was 
OL,22,Ffound at about 19:15 on Wednesday.G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
