OL,4,CScot extradited from Dubai charged     
OL,5,Cwith organised crime offences          
OL,6,GA man has been extradited to Scotland  
OL,7,Gfrom the United Arab Emirates (UAE) to 
OL,8,Gface organised crime charges.          
OL,10,FAlan Thomson is accused of running a   
OL,11,Fcross-border drug operation in Glasgow 
OL,12,Fand England between March and June     
OL,13,F2020.                                  
OL,15,FThomson, 46, and co-accused Mohamed    
OL,16,FEldirani, 55, are also alleged to have 
OL,17,F"furthered serious and organised       
OL,18,Fcrime" between March and June 2020.    
OL,20,FThe men made no plea during an initial 
OL,21,Fappearance at Glasgow Sheriff Court    
OL,22,Fand were remanded in custody.     G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
