OL,4,CRapist jailed after secretly recorded  
OL,5,Ccafe confession                        
OL,6,GA rapist who was caught after his      
OL,7,Gvictim secretly recorded his           
OL,8,Gconfession in a cafe has been jailed   
OL,9,Gfor five years.                        
OL,11,FDavid Smyth admitted having sex with   
OL,12,Fthe woman while she slept at a         
OL,13,Fproperty in Falkirk.                   
OL,15,FA court heard Smyth later told his     
OL,16,Fvictim, who had been on a night out    
OL,17,Fwith friends: "You couldn't say no in  
OL,18,Fthe state you were in."                
OL,20,FThe 36-year-old was found guilty of    
OL,21,Fraping the woman in 2019 following a   
OL,22,Ftrial at the High Court in StirlinG3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
