OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CTwo jailed for attacking man with      
OL,5,Cmachete and knife in Glasgow           
OL,6,GTwo men have been jailed after         
OL,7,Gattacking a man with a machete and a   
OL,8,Gknife in Glasgow.                      
OL,10,FAt the High Court in Edinburgh,        
OL,11,FMichael Frati, 32, was jailed for five 
OL,12,Fyears and four months, and Paul        
OL,13,FConnor, 49, was jailed for six years   
OL,14,Ffor the attack in Shettleston on 13    
OL,15,FMarch, 2024.                           
OL,17,FThe victim, Gerald Brennan, suffered   
OL,18,Fmultiple facial and head wounds, skull 
OL,19,Fand facial bone fractures, stab wounds 
OL,20,Fto his chest and back, a collapsed     
OL,21,Flung and extensive wounds to his hands 
OL,22,Fand wrists.                       G4/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
